1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,633
[JUNE] Yes, ma'am.

2
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:04,067
Your Ima-Asim Homemade Vinegar
order is on the way.

3
00:00:04,067 --> 00:00:07,133
Thank you so much. We hope you
order again in the future.

4
00:00:10,067 --> 00:00:11,133
[CLEARS THROAT]

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,100
Perfect!

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:23,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

7
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:24,167
What's that?

8
00:00:24,167 --> 00:00:26,267
It's to make the house
feel more welcoming.

9
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,600
You said you wouldn't
bother me.

10
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,467
I wasn't bothering you.

11
00:00:31,433 --> 00:00:33,200
I'm doing some cleaning.

12
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:40,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

13
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:54,300
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

14
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:00,800
[PHONE RINGING]

15
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:02,300
Hello?

16
00:01:03,367 --> 00:01:05,500
[PING]<i> I'll keep an eye on
</i> you the whole month.

17
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:09,333
<i>Are you involved
in the scam?</i>

18
00:01:09,333 --> 00:01:13,500
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

19
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:17,067
Okay. Bye, Ima.
Take care.

20
00:01:18,167 --> 00:01:25,133
[MUSIC BECOMES ROMANTIC]

21
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:40,733
[ROMANTIC MUSIC CONTINUES]

22
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:42,600
Do you need something?

23
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:43,633
[MUSIC STOPS]

24
00:01:44,433 --> 00:01:46,100
You were hypnotizing me,
weren't you?

25
00:01:48,567 --> 00:01:50,367
[CLEARS THROAT LOUDLY]

26
00:01:50,367 --> 00:01:52,233
I'm sorry I'm late, sir.

27
00:01:52,233 --> 00:01:59,200
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

28
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:02,367
Hey, hey, hey!

29
00:02:02,367 --> 00:02:04,067
Do you like Papa Ping?

30
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:09,233
Just so you know,
we used to be close.

31
00:02:09,233 --> 00:02:12,067
That was before
I came here.

32
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:16,367
Did you know I have something
that you don't?

33
00:02:17,733 --> 00:02:19,133
It's my face card.

34
00:02:19,133 --> 00:02:20,800
Supreme.

35
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,700
Elite.

36
00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:25,600
And platinum edition.

37
00:02:26,567 --> 00:02:28,133
So, move over.

38
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:31,233
We'll see about that.

39
00:02:32,433 --> 00:02:35,333
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

40
00:02:35,333 --> 00:02:37,500
[IN MOCKING VOICE]
"We'll see about that."

41
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:43,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]
